<title>DENMARK: Oeresundskonsortiet raises amount on 4% bond.</title>
<headline>Oeresundskonsortiet raises amount on 4% bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish-Swedish Oeresundskonsortiet said it raised an existing 200 million crown, four percent, 10 year bond offer to 700 million crowns, in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bond matures on November 15, 2005 and 300 million crowns would be added to the original offer on January 21 followed by a further 200 million crowns on January 22, it said. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
